# examples/scenes/01_stack, played: a game paused and resumed, and given up
# from the pause menu; the arrows moving the player and not the focus. Every
# transition is deferred to the end of the frame that asks for it, so
# `expect scene` is the scene on top once that frame is over. See
# tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# --- the happy path: play, pause, resume ------------------------------------

# Play has the focus from the first frame: Enter alone presses it.
1 tap KEY_ENTER
1 expect scene GameScene

# Ten points a second, and the arrows are the game's: GameScene reads them,
# so it is being played, and its HUD's Pause takes no focus by itself. Half a
# second of right and a little of down move the dot; the focus does not move
# onto Pause, and Enter does not press it.
3 press KEY_RIGHT
33 release KEY_RIGHT
34 press KEY_DOWN
40 release KEY_DOWN
41 tap KEY_ENTER
43 expect scene GameScene
44 shot playing

# Pause with the mouse: down on 45, up on 46, and the pause menu is pushed
# on top at the end of 46.
45 click 70 105
45 expect scene GameScene
46 expect scene PauseScene

# Sixty frames later the game below has not moved: it is suspended, not told
# to stop -- nothing in GameScene says "paused". Its HUD is still drawn,
# under the overlay's veil, and takes no input: a click on its Pause button
# does nothing at all.
106 click 70 105
108 expect scene PauseScene
108 shot frozen

# Resume has the focus (an overlay's first control): the gamepad's A pops
# it, and the score goes on from where it stopped.
109 tap GAMEPAD_BUTTON_RIGHT_FACE_DOWN
109 expect scene GameScene
129 shot resumed

# --- the failure path: give up ----------------------------------------------

# Pause again from the keyboard: Tab walks into the HUD, and Enter presses
# its one button. Then down to Give up: change<MainMenuScene>() clears the
# stack, and the game's _end() keeps its score as the best one, which the
# menu shows.
130 tap KEY_TAB
132 tap KEY_ENTER
132 expect scene PauseScene
134 tap KEY_DOWN
136 tap KEY_ENTER
136 expect scene MainMenuScene
147 shot best_kept
147 end
